# ---- Google Sheets (live registration counts) ----
# RECOMMENDED: API Key approach (no service account key needed, works with public sheets)
# 1. Make your Google Sheet publicly readable: Share -> Anyone with the link -> Viewer
# 2. Go to console.cloud.google.com -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> + Create Credentials -> API Key
# 3. (Optional) Restrict the key to "Google Sheets API" only
# 4. Paste the API Key below:
GOOGLE_API_KEY=AIzaSyDWjw6rXCuuZBdItPHxTk8nIS9Rvv2SFi8
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=1YynwBobcAJvQ1tN0YF92TA-6uhp_kukPOEAc3diatis
